{"4217940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trenchblocks", "steam_appid": 4217940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trenchblocks</strong> is a cute, colorful, and gloriously violent voxel-based first-person shooter where strategy, destruction, and adorable chaos collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter vibrant battlefields filled with grassy fields, towering stone castles, bright blue skies, and sparkling waters. Adorable little soldiers clash in fast, tactical, and endlessly replayable Capture the Flag matches where every block can be your greatest weapon — or your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag Like Never Before</strong> Two teams. Red vs Blue. First to 3 flag captures wins. Defend your flag by rapidly building forts or digging deep defensive trenches. Capture the enemy flag by any means necessary — including digging massive tunnels straight under their base. The battlefield is fully alive and destructible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Voxel Destruction</strong> Shoot, dig, and collapse entire structures. Voxel groups break apart realistically, changing sightlines, creating new paths, or burying players under rubble. No two matches ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features – Early Access 1.0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 signature weapons: Garand, Pump Shotgun, SMG, and LMG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character skin customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad system — create, join, and drop into battle with friends directly from the main menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity VOIP  + text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full community server support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop  — create and share custom maps in minutes</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trenchblocks</strong> is a cute, colorful, and gloriously violent voxel-based first-person shooter where strategy, destruction, and adorable chaos collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter vibrant battlefields filled with grassy fields, towering stone castles, bright blue skies, and sparkling waters. Adorable little soldiers clash in fast, tactical, and endlessly replayable Capture the Flag matches where every block can be your greatest weapon — or your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag Like Never Before</strong> Two teams. Red vs Blue. First to 3 flag captures wins. Defend your flag by rapidly building forts or digging deep defensive trenches. Capture the enemy flag by any means necessary — including digging massive tunnels straight under their base. The battlefield is fully alive and destructible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Voxel Destruction</strong> Shoot, dig, and collapse entire structures. Voxel groups break apart realistically, changing sightlines, creating new paths, or burying players under rubble. No two matches ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features – Early Access 1.0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 signature weapons: Garand, Pump Shotgun, SMG, and LMG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character skin customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad system — create, join, and drop into battle with friends directly from the main menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity VOIP  + text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full community server support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop  — create and share custom maps in minutes</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Dig, build, and destroy in a cute yet violent voxel shooter! Battle in Capture the Flag where you construct forts, dig trenches, or tunnel under enemy bases with full voxel destruction.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><